⍝ trith/lib/ws.c: echo servers (plain and TLS) and their client in one program, split by fork.
⍝ The test runner makes the certificate and has the client trust it (SSL_CERT_FILE)
⎔ $fork$ ⟨⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹fork› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_listen$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹listen› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_listen_tls$ ⟨ℤ ʃ ʃ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹listentls› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_accept$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹accept› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_connect$ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹connect› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_send$ ⟨ℤ ⸮ʃ ⊸ ◌ℤ⟩ ‹send› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_receive$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ⸮◌ʃ⟩ ‹recv› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_close$ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹wclose› ⸫
⎔ $trith_ws_error$ ⟨⊸ ʃ⟩ ‹werror› ⸫

⍝ ‹or› s: the text, or ? if there is none (what came over the network is hearsay, ⸮)
⦃ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ $?$ ⦄ ⦄ ⟨⸮◌ʃ ⊸ ⸮ʃ⟩ ‹or› ⸫

⍝ ‹echo› conn: send every message back until the client closes
⦃
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:c
    ⧗:c ⧗:c ⧗:c ‹recv› ⁇ ⦃ ‹send› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄
  ⦄
  ‹wclose› ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹echo› ⸫

⍝ ‹serve› server: serve one client, then stop
⦃ ⧖:s ⧗:s ‹accept› ⁇ ⦃ ‹echo› ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⧗:s ‹wclose› ⌁ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹serve› ⸫
⍝ ‹child› server tls: one client of each
⦃ ⧖:s,t ⧗:s ‹serve› ⧗:t ‹serve› ⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹child› ⸫

⍝ ‹say› conn text: send text and print what comes back
⦃ ⧖:c,t ⧗:c ⧗:t̵ ‹send› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⧗:c ‹recv› ‹or› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹say› ⸫

⍝ ‹talk› conn: the client's side of the conversation
⦃
  ⧖:c
  ⧗:c $hello, socket$ ‹say›
  ⧗:c $héllo ✓$ ‹say›
  ⧗:c $01234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789$ ‹send› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄
  $a long message comes back with length $ ⎙̵ ⧗:c ‹recv› ‹or› ⟗ ⍴̱ ⎙ ⌁̵
  ⧗:c ‹wclose› ⌁
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹talk› ⸫

⍝ ‹parent› server tls: the client, the only side that prints
⦃
  ‹wclose› ⌁ ‹wclose› ⌁
  $ws://127.0.0.1:8472/chat$ ‹connect› ⁇ ⦃ ‹talk› ⦄ ⦃ $cannot connect: $ ⎙̵ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  ⍝ the certificate is for localhost and 127.0.0.1, so 127.0.0.2 (also this machine) is refused
  $wss://127.0.0.2:8477/$ ‹connect› ⁇ ⦃ ‹wclose› ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  $wss://localhost:8477/chat$ ‹connect› ⁇ ⦃ ‹talk› ⦄ ⦃ $cannot connect: $ ⎙̵ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
  $ws://127.0.0.1:1/$ ‹connect› ⁇ ⦃ ‹wclose› ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹parent› ⸫

⍝ ‹both› server tls: fork into the servers and the client
⦃
  ⧖:s,t
  ⧗:s,t ‹fork› ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹child› ⦄ ⦃ ‹parent› ⦄ ⦃ ‹wclose› ⌁ ‹wclose› ⌁ $fork failed\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹both› ⸫

⍝ ‹start› server: open the TLS server too
⦃
  ⧖:s
  ⧗:s #8477# $output/lib-test/cert.pem$ $output/lib-test/key.pem$ ‹listentls›
    ⁇ ⦃ ‹both› ⦄ ⦃ $cannot listen: $ ⎙̵ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ‹wclose› ⌁ ⦄
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹start› ⸫

⦃
  #8472# ‹listen› ⁇
    ⦃ ‹start› ⦄
    ⦃ $cannot listen: $ ⎙̵ ‹werror› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
